{"book":"hono","chapter":"helpers","chapterTitle":"المساعدات","slug":"index","title":"مساعد `Accepts`","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"import","text":"Import"},{"depth":2,"id":"accepts","text":"accepts()"},{"depth":3,"id":"acceptheader-نوع","text":"AcceptHeader نوع"},{"depth":2,"id":"الخيارات","text":"الخيارات"},{"depth":3,"id":"header-acceptheader","text":"header: AcceptHeader"},{"depth":3,"id":"يدعم-string","text":"يدعم: string[]"},{"depth":3,"id":"default-string","text":"default: string"},{"depth":3,"id":"match-accepts-accept-config-acceptsconfig-gt-string","text":"match: (accepts: Accept[], config: acceptsConfig) =&gt; string"}],"html":"<p>يساعد Accepts Helper في التعامل مع ترويسات Accept في الطلبات.</p>\n<h2 id=\"import\">Import</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { accepts } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/accepts&#x27;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"accepts\"><code>accepts()</code></h2>\n<p>الـ <code>accepts()</code> تنظر الدالة إلى ترويسة Accept، مثل Accept-Encoding و Accept-Language، وتعيد القيمة المناسبة.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { accepts } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/accepts&#x27;</span>\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> accept = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">accepts</span>(c, {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">header</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Accept-Language&#x27;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">supports</span>: [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;en&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;ja&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;zh&#x27;</span>],\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">default</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;en&#x27;</span>,\n  })\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">lang</span>: accept })\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"acceptheader-نوع\"><code>AcceptHeader</code> نوع</h3>\n<p>تعريف <code>AcceptHeader</code> النوع كما يلي.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">AcceptHeader</span> =\n  | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Accept&#x27;</span>\n  | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Accept-Charset&#x27;</span>\n  | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Accept-Encoding&#x27;</span>\n  | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Accept-Language&#x27;</span>\n  | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Accept-Patch&#x27;</span>\n  | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Accept-Post&#x27;</span>\n  | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Accept-Ranges&#x27;</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"الخيارات\">الخيارات</h2>\n<h3 id=\"header-acceptheader\"><Badge type=\"danger\" text=\"required\" /> header: <code>AcceptHeader</code></h3>\n<p>ترويسة accept الهدف.</p>\n<h3 id=\"يدعم-string\"><Badge type=\"danger\" text=\"required\" /> يدعم: <code>string[]</code></h3>\n<p>قيم الترويسة التي يدعمها تطبيقك.</p>\n<h3 id=\"default-string\"><Badge type=\"danger\" text=\"required\" /> default: <code>string</code></h3>\n<p>القيم الافتراضية.</p>\n<h3 id=\"match-accepts-accept-config-acceptsconfig-gt-string\"><Badge type=\"info\" text=\"optional\" /> match: <code>(accepts: Accept[], config: acceptsConfig) =&gt; string</code></h3>\n<p>دالة المطابقة المخصصة.</p>\n"}